1
00:00:00,390 --> 00:00:02,450
What if you got one Robux every time

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:03,230
you blinked?

3
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:05,310
It's real!

4
00:00:05,890 --> 00:00:06,330
Day 1.

5
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:07,930
You blink as fast as you can.

6
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:09,950
100 Robux!

7
00:00:10,330 --> 00:00:10,850
Day 2.

8
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:12,530
Your eyes are so dry.

9
00:00:12,770 --> 00:00:13,970
Mom thinks you're winking at her.

10
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:16,210
Why do you keep winking at me?

11
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:17,390
Day 3.

12
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:18,470
You're rich!

13
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:21,470
The Dominus, the Mansion, the rarest pet in

14
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:21,950
the game!

15
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:22,910
Day 4.

16
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:24,050
You blink in class.

17
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:26,450
Everyone's staring at you.

18
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:28,830
Everyone who subscribes gets one free blink.

19
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:30,390
Day 5.

20
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:32,270
Mom has had enough.

21
00:00:32,570 --> 00:00:34,070
Staring contest, sweetie.

22
00:00:34,430 --> 00:00:36,750
If you blink, no more Robux.

23
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:39,390
Mom has never lost a staring contest.

24
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:41,810
One hour, three hours.

25
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:42,810
Must.

26
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:43,770
Not.

27
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:44,670
Blink.

28
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:46,770
Then mom blows in your face.

29
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:47,490
No!

30
00:00:48,210 --> 00:00:49,850
No more Robux, sweetie!

31
00:00:50,390 --> 00:00:51,750
But then the game updated.

32
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:54,050
Now every blink costs one Robux.

33
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:56,090
Comment blink if you just blinked!
